bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Figaro_Pennygood\" title=\"Figaro Pennygood\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/25px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/38px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/50px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Figaro Pennygood\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png/25px-Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Figaro_Pennygood.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Figaro_Pennygood\" title=\"Figaro Pennygood\">Figaro Pennygood</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Facemaker%27s_Boutique\" title=\"Facemaker's Boutique\">Facemaker's Boutique</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sticky_Dondo\" title=\"Sticky Dondo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Sticky_Dondo.png/25px-Portrait_Sticky_Dondo.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Sticky_Dondo.png/38px-Portrait_Sticky_Dondo.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Sticky_Dondo.png/50px-Portrait_Sticky_Dondo.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sticky Dondo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/28/Portrait_Sticky_Dondo.png/25px-Portrait_Sticky_Dondo.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/28/Portrait_Sticky_Dondo.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sticky_Dondo\" title=\"Sticky Dondo\">Sticky Dondo</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Undercity_Ruins\" title=\"Undercity Ruins\">Undercity Ruins</a></li></ul></l